      "evidence_id": "EV_001",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "speaker_role": "nurse",
      "transcript_text": "Doctor, Mr Hale, hives on and off for a fortnight. I've done his obs. Temperature 36.8, pulse 80, blood pressure 124 over 76.",
