      "end_timestamp": "00:27",
      "supports": [
        "symptoms[0]"
      ]
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "EV_003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "speaker_role": "patient",
      "transcript_text": "Big red lumps, wherever. Arms, back, thighs. They itch like mad, last a few hours, then go, and come back somewhere else.",
